msgid "Here's how the gimbal works: the outer node can only be rotated in **Y**, while the inner one rotates only in **X**. You can test this out by rotating them manually, but make sure you change to \"Local Space Mode\" first (that's the cube icon next to the lock in the menu bar - the keyboard shortcut to toggle is \"T\"). Remember to only move the _green_ ring of the outer node and only the _red_ ring of the inner one. Don't touch the camera node at all."
msgstr ""

#: 3D/camera_gimbal.md
