#: games/first_2d/first_2d_09.md
msgid "We start by making a list of the coordinates in the image where each digit is found. Then, `display_digits()` will format the number to an 8 digit number (for example, `258` would become `\"00000258\"`). Then, for each digit, we can apply the correct coordinates from the array."
