#: games/first_2d/first_2d_09.md
msgid "Name the {{< gd-icon TextureRect >}}`TextureRect` `Digit0`. Under **Texture**, select \"New AtlasTexture\", then click the box to open it. Drag `Number_font (8 x 8).png` into the **Atlas** property, then set the **Region** to `(32, 8, 8, 8)`. Set **Stretch Mode** to \"Keep Aspect Centered\"."
msgstr ""

